# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unpublished Watchdog recaps                     (added 2026-09-02)
#
# The weekly Watchdog task writes a new recap page into watchdog/
# every week. Those drafts are NOT ready to go live, and having them
# sit in GitHub Desktop meant unchecking them on every single commit.
# This hides the unpublished ones so the changes list stays clean.
#
# This does NOT affect the four recaps already published. Git ignores
# only untracked files, so those still show up normally if edited.
#
# TO PUBLISH A RECAP: comment out the line below, commit the recap
# page together with the matching card in watchdog.html, then
# uncomment it again. The cards and the pages must go up together or
# the Watchdog page will link to something that is not there.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
watchdog/*.html
